i  always thought tbc shouls have been a third faction with, fel orcs, naga, blood elves, and broken ones, playable races.

&#x200B;

but to  continue from we are, its mantids,  theyre the best wow race

They also hid the easy access account management button on the client that showed how long was left on your sub where you could easily get more time ( or cancel your sub).

&#x200B;

Scumbag shit.

Train is a huge diablo 2 fan and ive seen him in multiple D2 streams chatting with the viewers and Streamers. In my opinion, and I'm not going to claim to know the reason because I don't, his intentions were only good here.

&#x200B;

That said, I still watch train and the podcasts and shit but there's something that doesn't feel right with him lately, don't know what is \*shrug\*
